## [upstream] integration: guard the cquad error estimate against nc == 0

Commit: f20496de6

Savannah bug #59913 reports a SIGFPE (arithmetic exception) inside
`gsl_integration_cquad()`.  A 2025 follow-up could not reproduce the
original program, but the underlying defect is present:
`integration/cquad.c` forms the initial error estimate with

